WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.890
This is Today.

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:05.149
We call it Reality, because it shows what really matters right now.

00:00:05.149 --> 00:00:06.866
At the top is your summary.

00:00:06.866 --> 00:00:10.490
Underneath is the homework that is due, with a countdown.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:15.893
If the countdown says approx, the date is an estimate, so check it with your teacher.

00:00:15.893 --> 00:00:20.471
The signal bars show how your week is going, and your XP sits alongside.

00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:23.586
You can read the whole page in about ten seconds.

00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:26.828
Open it once a day and you will not get caught out.

00:00:26.828 --> 00:00:30.198
Try it now: look at the first countdown on your list.

